// ============================================================
// Milestone 8 — Signal Intelligence Engine (v2.7.0)
//   ✓ Foundation (v2.0.1)
//   ✓ Liquidity Engine (v2.1.0)
//   ✓ FVG Engine (v2.2.0)
//   ✓ Market Structure Engine (v2.3.0)
//   ✓ Confluence Scoring Engine (v2.4.0)
//   ✓ Trade Management Engine (v2.5.0)
//   ✓ Setup Lifecycle Engine (v2.6.0)
//   ✓ Signal Intelligence Engine (v2.7.0)
//       ✓ Displacement Detection — body%, range/ATR, volume/SMA grading
//       ✓ FVG 5-state quality model (Fresh→First Touch→CE Touch→Deep Retest→Mitigated)
//       ✓ Sweep grading A/B/C (volume, wick rejection, displacement)
//       ✓ Fibonacci OTE Zone (50–70.5% retracement)
//       ✓ News Calendar Engine (EIA/API pre-news block, post-news bonus)
//       ✓ Kill Zone scoring (London/NY/India open +10)
//       ✓ PDH/PDL sweep bonus (+15)
//       ✓ Inducement detection (double-sweep pattern +10)
//       ✓ Rejection candle confirmation (+10)
//       ✓ Candle close confirmation at FVG entry
//       ✓ Structure-aligned FVG filter + counter-trend purge on CHoCH
//       ✓ Consecutive candle validation for FVG formation
//       ✓ Signal diamonds filtered by structure direction
//       ✓ UI cleanup — OB border-only, FVG lighter, OTE purple
//       ✓ Confluence max score: 225
//
// Patch v2.7.1 — Phase 2 bugfixes
//   ✓ News Calendar: instrument-aware filter (IS_CRUDE / IS_NATGAS / IS_EQUITY)
//       — EIA Crude blocks only on CL/CRUDE tickers (Wed 14:30 UTC)
//       — API Crude blocks only on CL/CRUDE tickers (Tue 20:30 UTC)
//       — EIA Nat Gas blocks only on NG/NATGAS tickers (Thu 14:30 UTC)
//       — Gold, Nifty, equities, FX: no auto events — manual override only
//       — NEWS_EVENT now shows "EIA Crude" / "API Crude" / "EIA Nat Gas"
//   ✓ OTE Zone: adaptive timeframe lookback (×16/×12/×8/×6 by TF)
//       — prevents zone from using too few bars on 15m/1H/Daily charts
//   ✓ OTE Zone: bullish Fibonacci math verified + annotated
//   ✓ OTE Box label: shows direction (▲ Bull / ▼ Bear)
//
// v3.1.0 — Score Rescale + Win-Rate Tracker + Alert Refinement + News Pre-Positioning
//   ✓ Confluence score rescaled from ~285 max → clean 0–100 scale
//       — All 23 weights rebalanced: Core ICT ~50 pts, HTF ~25, Quality ~15, Support ~10
//       — Star ratings recalibrated (★★★★★ = 70+, ★★★★ = 55+, ★★★ = 40+, ★★ = 25+, ★ = 12+)
//       — Default signal threshold: 55 (was 85), entry min: 40 (was 60)
//       — Score overlay colour thresholds: 70+ bright, 55+ mid, <55 dim
//       — Dashboard score display updated to "/ 100"
//   ✓ Win-Rate Tracker (Section 17)
//       — Persistent counters: TP2, TP1+BE, SL across full chart history
//       — Shows: Trades, TP2, TP1+BE, SL, Win%, Total R, Avg R/Trade, Expectancy, Avg Score/100
//       — Colour-coded: green ≥60% / yellow 40–60% / red <40%
//   ✓ Score-Gated Alert Refinement
//       — ALT_SWEEP_BULL/BEAR, ALT_CE_BULL/BEAR, ALT_CHOCH_BULL/BEAR
//       — All gate on IN_ALERT_MIN_SCORE (default 55) — eliminates low-quality noise
//   ✓ News Pre-Positioning Engine
//       — Pre window captures HTF+structure bias as expected post-news direction
//       — Post window fires ALT_PREPOS_BULL/BEAR when sweep confirms direction
//       — +8 score bonus on confirmation; dashboard shows ► (armed) / ✓ (confirmed)
// ============================================================

//@version=6
indicator(
     title            = "LSS Pro v3.1.0",
     shorttitle       = "LSS Pro",
     overlay          = true,
     max_labels_count = 100,
     max_lines_count  = 150,
     max_boxes_count  = 75
 )

